12 |     opens_one_leaf::<Option<Vec<i32>>>();
   |                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this target cannot be decrypted from one ciphertext
   |
   = help: the trait `TakesScalar` is not implemented for `vitaminc_aead::typed::List<i32>`
   = note: `vitaminc_aead::typed::List<i32>` is the target's sink, and it does not read a single scalar
   = note: a single ciphertext decrypts into a scalar such as `String`, `i64` or `Vec<u8>`, an `Option` or a `Protected` of one, or a newtype that derives `Decrypt` over one
   = note: to decrypt many values, decrypt a `Vec<Ciphertext>`, which opens each ciphertext into one element; to decrypt a sequence, a map or a struct that was encrypted as a tree, use `decrypt_tree`
   = help: the following other types implement trait `TakesScalar`:
             Optional<T>
             OwnedFrameSink
             ProtectedOptional<T>
             ScalarProtected<T>
             ScalarSink<T>
             Wrap<S>
